                    <ref target="frus1949v04#pg_51">Vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">iv</hi>, p.
                        51</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d319-f3" n="3" xml:id="d319-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed. In regard to the <hi rendition="#italic">démarche</hi> made to
                    Norway, however, see editorial note and despatch No. 51 from Oslo on February
                    10, 1949, <ref target="frus1949v04#pg_53">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp. 53</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus1949v04#pg_91">91</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d319-f4" n="4" xml:id="d319-f4-content">
                <p>Address on “The American Course in Foreign Affairs”; for text, see Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, February 6, 1949, p. 157.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
